[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13922.07, "timestamp": "03:52:02", "text": "すでに。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13924.95, "timestamp": "03:52:04", "text": "基本的なライフル、ミニガン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13928.15, "timestamp": "03:52:08", "text": "なぜこんな風に感じるんだろう、ああ、これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13931.11, "timestamp": "03:52:11", "text": "これはRobloxですか？一体どういうことだ？うん、そうだね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13933.51, "timestamp": "03:52:13", "text": "Robloxです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13936.07, "timestamp": "03:52:16", "text": "自分で3Dを作ることもできますし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13941.59, "timestamp": "03:52:21", "text": "それがこのことの面白いところなんだ。あなたはできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13954.79, "timestamp": "03:52:34", "text": "私は今、スパム攻撃で人々を殺している。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13958.63, "timestamp": "03:52:38", "text": "今は運任せな状態だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13962.389, "timestamp": "03:52:42", "text": "あなたは53番街にいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13964.55, "timestamp": "03:52:44", "text": "君は私を殺したんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13966.95, "timestamp": "03:52:46", "text": "おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13969.349, "timestamp": "03:52:49", "text": "背後から殺されたな。待って、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13973.189, "timestamp": "03:52:53", "text": "お前を殺したんだ。何？はい。"}]